keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - cpp
  - tensor-library
  - optimization
  - systems-programming
abstract: >-
  MiniTensor is a lightweight, high-performance C++ library for tensor operations 
  and neural network inference, built with a focus on low-level cache optimizations 
  and hardware utilization.
